(370, 52, NULL, 'independent', '2026-09-01 15:53:00', 'Six Curcuma accessions DNA extraction and quality measurement\r\n\r\n1. Performed DNA extraction for turmeric (Curcuma longa) accessions CL-2 and CL-4 in the morning.\r\n2. Performed DNA extraction for four additional Curcuma samples, CEK-4, CEK-5, TR-3B, and TR-10, in the afternoon.\r\n3. Measured DNA concentration and purity using the Qubit Fluorometer and NanoDrop spectrophotometer.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uO1WpjMe1hKQVmSdeK9xH42BuCn363s5/view', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 46, '2026-11-09 09:53:23', NULL, '2026-11-09 06:55:14', '2026-11-09 09:53:23'),
(371, 52, NULL, 'independent', '2026-09-02 15:22:00', 'DNA extraction and Qubit measurement of eight Curcuma accessions\r\n\r\n1. Performed DNA extraction for eight Curcuma accessions: CL-37, CL-44, CL-93, CL-95, TR-02, CL-66, CL-31, and CL-81.\r\n2. Measured DNA concentration using the Qubit Fluorometer to evaluate the extraction results.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/open?id=1QAy0xiEBGqsJKlX4EhP5th_pWe1c4f_j', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 46, '2026-11-09 09:53:32', NULL, '2026-11-09 06:56:08', '2026-11-09 09:53:32'),
(373, 52, NULL, 'independent', '2026-09-03 15:26:00', 'Internal meeting, Qubit measurement, turmeric database update, and DNA extraction\r\n\r\n1.Attended an internal morning meeting to discuss ongoing laboratory activities \r\n2. Measured DNA concentration of 8 samples using the Qubit Fluorometer.\r\n3. Updated the turmeric (Curcuma longa) sample database, including GH sample records.\r\n4. Performed DNA extraction for turmeric (Curcuma longa) accessions CL-13 and CL-61.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/open?id=1b1lppcYdUscrReOXjFY_dvBsN9PIxXjn', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 46, '2026-11-09 09:53:42', NULL, '2026-11-09 06:57:28', '2026-11-09 09:53:42'),
(374, 52, NULL, 'independent', '2026-09-04 15:33:00', 'Turmeric field survey, plant database update, extraction assessment, and internal meeting\r\n 	\r\n1. Conducted a field survey of turmeric (Curcuma longa) plants to assess plant condition and sample availability.\r\n2. Updated the field plant database, including sample identification and records.\r\n3. Checked available plants to determine which samples were available for DNA extraction.\r\n4. Attended an internal meeting to discuss the work plan and activities for the following week.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'logbook-documentation/FDpZJBJPNCJaNPjOymo2wZV64P1dOjHFlQVkb9D4.jpg', NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/open?id=1AGDe2XNfzcSApszFtrSYVMw0MoRANYtK', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 46, '2026-11-09 09:53:54', NULL, '2026-11-09 06:58:38', '2026-11-09 09:53:54'),
(375, 52, NULL, 'independent', '2026-09-07 16:11:00', 'DNA extraction report writing and turmeric DNA extraction optimization\r\n 	\r\n1. Completed the DNA extraction reports for experiments conducted from August 31 to September 3, including documentation and observations.\r\n2. Performed DNA extraction for turmeric (Curcuma longa) accessions CL-96, CL-32, CL-58, and CL-12 using an optimized step of air-drying the beads with the cap open for 6 minutes.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/open?id=1gXYdFwTByfaSVX2SOYfTA0b47I0WHXB2', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 46, '2026-11-09 09:54:03', NULL, '2026-11-09 07:01:11', '2026-11-09 09:54:03'),
(376, 52, NULL, 'independent', '2026-09-08 16:16:00', 'DNA extraction optimization (4 accessions of turmeric)\r\nPerformed DNA extraction for turmeric (Curcuma longa) accessions CL-55, CL-84, CL-24, and CL-21 using an optimized bead air-drying step of 7 minutes with the cap open.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/open?id=1HTyczd6RbUmRR2I4O2pqz_xQsVPf8fhP', '[\"https:\\/\\/drive.google.com\\/open?id=1HTyczd6RbUmRR2I4O2pqz_xQsVPf8fhP\"]', NULL, 'approved', NULL, 46, '2026-11-09 09:54:11', NULL, '2026-11-09 08:35:22', '2026-11-09 09:54:11'),
(377, 52, NULL, 'independent', '2026-09-09 16:23:00', 'Field survey, data entry, and summary of five empon-empon species\r\n\r\n\r\nScreenshot 2026-09-11 at 16.18.54 - ester sinaga.png\r\nPratinjau thumbnail untuk URL yang ditautkan\r\nPegawai TSTH2 adalah pemilik\r\nTidak ada perubahan sejak Anda melihat file ini terakhir kali\r\n 	\r\n1. Prepared the survey form for the field data collection.\r\n2. Surveyed five empon-empon species in the field and greenhouse (GH).\r\n3. Entered the collected survey data into the database.\r\n4. Compiled a summary of the collected data for further review.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'logbook-documentation/vLCO9KMEmP3NlA8zXuQeNdBV78Hj89afKVzrv5Mk.png', '[\"logbook-documentation\\/vLCO9KMEmP3NlA8zXuQeNdBV78Hj89afKVzrv5Mk.png\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 46, '2026-11-09 09:54:21', NULL, '2026-11-09 09:24:41', '2026-11-09 09:54:21'),
