(379, 52, NULL, 'independent', '2026-09-11 16:35:00', 'DNA normalization and electrophoresis preparation\r\n\r\n\r\n10.09 - ester sinaga.2026 after\r\nPratinjau thumbnail untuk URL yang ditautkan\r\nPegawai TSTH2 adalah pemilik\r\nTidak ada perubahan sejak Anda melihat file ini terakhir kali\r\n 	\r\n1. Normalized 45 DNA samples in preparation for the electrophoresis procedure.\r\n2. Prepared and organized the equipment and consumables required for the electrophoresis activity at ITDel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://drive.google.com/open?id=1cmQTeF2TLR7xwrrQHuy9yBwHkfT4mKS8fDnpfM6Abso', '[\"https:\\/\\/drive.google.com\\/open?id=1cmQTeF2TLR7xwrrQHuy9yBwHkfT4mKS8fDnpfM6Abso\",\"https:\\/\\/drive.google.com\\/open?id=1FFxFw7thsfwbG5XAQHhyz77BkN1T4wuH\"]', NULL, 'approved', NULL, 46, '2026-11-09 09:54:39', NULL, '2026-11-09 09:28:17', '2026-11-09 09:54:39'),
